<slide>
  text-size: 3.8vmin
</slide>

<h2>Controls</h2>

<ul>
  <li><b>→ Space PageDown Enter</b> next step · <b>← PageUp Backspace</b> previous</li>
  <li><b>Home / End</b> first / last · click right 3/4 = next, left 1/4 = back · swipe on touch screens</li>
  <li><b>o</b> slide drawer (thumbnails of all slides, stays open while you present) · <b>t</b> theme · <b>f</b> fullscreen · <b>p</b> presenter window · <b>h</b> help</li>
  <li>URL: <c>#12</c> jumps to step 12, <c>?theme=paper</c> picks a theme, <c>?deck=name</c> picks a deck</li>
</ul>

<notes>
  Steps are numbered across the whole deck; every animation frame is a step.
</notes>
